## Overview

This is a **TEMPLATE** cluster-config.md. For new deployments:

1. Fill in `config/cluster-reference.env` (copy from `.template`)
2. Run Pipeline 1 ("ZTP Config Bootstrap") to generate this file automatically
3. Or manually copy this template and fill in your values

> **DO NOT** edit this template file directly. It is the reference scaffolding
> that `Generate-ConfigFromReference.ps1` uses as its output format.

| Detail | Value |
|--------|-------|
| **Cluster Name** | `[CHANGE-ME]` |
| **Configuration Type** | Converged Intent with External Storage |
| **Node Count** | [CHANGE-ME]x Dell AX-760 |
| **Azure Region** | [CHANGE-ME] |
| **Last Updated** | [AUTO-GENERATED] |
| **Generated From** | cluster-reference.env |

